    "group": "Hexwarp Thrallband",
    "summary": "The Flow of Magic always covers your own deployment zone. Check No Man’s Land and the enemy deployment zone at the start of each phase. A zone joins for that phase if you hold half or more of its objectives. Your THOUSAND SONS models re-roll Wound rolls of 1 for [PSYCHIC] attacks. A model wholly inside the Flow of Magic adds 1 to that Wound roll instead.",
